---
import './Hero.css';
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow h-in" style="--i:0">Pizza artesanal · delivery</div>
    <h1 aria-label="A pizza que você merece comer."><span class="line"><span style="--i:0">A pizza que</span></span><span class="line"><span style="--i:1">você <em>merece</em></span></span><span class="line"><span style="--i:2">comer.</span></span></h1>
    <p class="lede h-in" style="--i:1">Massa que descansa dois dias na geladeira, borda pintadinha que estala e sabor de casa.</p>
    <div class="ctas solo h-in" style="--i:2"><a class="btn btn-red" id="heroCta" data-src="hero" href="#montar"><span class="t">Montar pedido</span><svg class="ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6"/></svg></a></div>
    <p class="hero-status h-in" style="--i:3" data-status-long>Quinta a sábado, das 18h às 23h</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-pizza">
    <div class="badge48"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><path id="c" d="M50,50 m-38,0 a38,38 0 1,1 76,0 a38,38 0 1,1 -76,0"/></defs><text font-family="DM Sans" font-weight="700" font-size="8.4" fill="currentColor"><textPath href="#c" textLength="234" lengthAdjust="spacing">FERMENTAÇÃO LONGA · FEITA À MÃO ·</textPath></text></svg><b>48h</b></div>
    <svg class="hero-steam" viewBox="0 0 100 130" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 120c-14-18 14-30 0-52s14-34 0-56"/><path d="M52 124c-14-18 14-30 0-52s14-34 0-56"/><path d="M74 120c-14-18 14-30 0-52s14-34 0-56"/></svg>
    <div class="plate" id="plate"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="img/pizza-top-cut-480.avif 480w, img/pizza-top-cut-720.avif 720w, img/pizza-top-cut-950.avif 950w" sizes="(min-width:980px) 62vw, 118vw"><img src="img/pizza-top-cut-950.webp" srcset="img/pizza-top-cut-480.webp 480w, img/pizza-top-cut-720.webp 720w, img/pizza-top-cut-950.webp 950w" sizes="(min-width:980px) 62vw, 118vw" alt="Pizza de calabresa com borda pintadinha vista de cima" width="950" height="942" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></picture></div>
  </div>
</section>
